{"4962700": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Chronicles Of Lumethis", "steam_appid": 4962700, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The realm of Lumethis was shattered by the Sundering, and the Aether Tide that sustains it is failing. You are a Tidecaller — you don't swing the sword yourself. You pull lost champions out of the Aether, re-forge them shard by shard, and send them to mend a broken world... until the Demon God Vharzuul returns, and the real war begins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chronicles of Lumethis</strong> is a single-player idle/AFK RPG where every system feeds another: gather, craft, fight, collect — and keep progressing while the game is closed. There is no prestige, no rebirth, no reset. All progression is forward, forever.<br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4962700/extras/a37e6facede08032307cedf48187236b.avif?t=1785600214\" width=1122 height=1402 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Summon a roster. Embody one champion at a time.</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Collect <strong>70+ champions</strong> across six rarities, each with a class that shapes how it fights.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Legendary and Mythic champions can't be pulled — they're <strong>forged by Synthesis</strong>, fusing duplicates up the rarity ladder.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Ascend champions to 5★ with shards, then <strong>awaken Mythics to 10★</strong> in the endgame. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A wide roster is real power: class counters, 51 collection teams, and monster trophies pay permanent account-wide bonuses.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4962700/extras/fc61b97e16153599221dd622fc19902c.avif?t=1785600214\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4962700/extras_big/fc61b97e16153599221dd622fc19902c.avif?t=1785600214 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >An economy where everything matters</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Mine ore on  node picks, land fish in a timing minigame, brew potions, forge and socket gems, and enhance gear from +1 to a risky +9.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Gear is a <strong>shared pool</strong> — deck out whichever champion you embody, from three loot tiers to 9-piece unique sets with build-defining bonuses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Hunt <strong>elite monsters</strong> for 15 one-of-a-kind Relics that bend the whole game's rules.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Battle, mining, and fishing share a small pool of <strong>action slots</strong> — what runs in parallel is a real decision, and your last activity keeps working offline.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A world worth reclaiming</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 8 kingdom zones, roguelike <strong>dungeon runs</strong> with pick-a-boon rooms, AFK farm expeditions, and keyed Trials and Rifts that guard the mythic gear sets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Chaptered story quests build from quiet preparation to the gate of the Demon God.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Slay the world boss <strong>Nethrax</strong> under hard rules — no potions, one life — to open the demon gate.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >An endless war</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The <strong>Demon God Invasion</strong>: infinite generated stages with bosses, generals, and milestone chests.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Every climb converts into permanent power — a never-resetting Dominion tree, awakened Mythics, and endgame set drops.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Face <strong>Vharzuul himself</strong> again and again: each fallen generation raises a stronger heir with a new demon type, so a different counter-champion carries each war.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4962700/extras/7ad9f537835e2683b1b654efbc25a106.avif?t=1785600214\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4962700/extras_big/7ad9f537835e2683b1b654efbc25a106.avif?t=1785600214 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every summon is earned in play. No microtransactions — just a broken world, a deep loop, and all the time it keeps working for you.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The realm of Lumethis was shattered by the Sundering, and the Aether Tide that sustains it is failing. You are a Tidecaller — you don't swing the sword yourself. You pull lost champions out of the Aether, re-forge them shard by shard, and send them to mend a broken world... until the Demon God Vharzuul returns, and the real war begins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chronicles of Lumethis</strong> is a single-player idle/AFK RPG where every system feeds another: gather, craft, fight, collect — and keep progressing while the game is closed. There is no prestige, no rebirth, no reset. All progression is forward, forever.<br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4962700/extras/a37e6facede08032307cedf48187236b.avif?t=1785600214\" width=1122 height=1402 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Summon a roster. Embody one champion at a time.</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Collect <strong>70+ champions</strong> across six rarities, each with a class that shapes how it fights.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Legendary and Mythic champions can't be pulled — they're <strong>forged by Synthesis</strong>, fusing duplicates up the rarity ladder.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Ascend champions to 5★ with shards, then <strong>awaken Mythics to 10★</strong> in the endgame. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A wide roster is real power: class counters, 51 collection teams, and monster trophies pay permanent account-wide bonuses.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4962700/extras/fc61b97e16153599221dd622fc19902c.avif?t=1785600214\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4962700/extras_big/fc61b97e16153599221dd622fc19902c.avif?t=1785600214 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >An economy where everything matters</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Mine ore on  node picks, land fish in a timing minigame, brew potions, forge and socket gems, and enhance gear from +1 to a risky +9.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Gear is a <strong>shared pool</strong> — deck out whichever champion you embody, from three loot tiers to 9-piece unique sets with build-defining bonuses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Hunt <strong>elite monsters</strong> for 15 one-of-a-kind Relics that bend the whole game's rules.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Battle, mining, and fishing share a small pool of <strong>action slots</strong> — what runs in parallel is a real decision, and your last activity keeps working offline.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A world worth reclaiming</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 8 kingdom zones, roguelike <strong>dungeon runs</strong> with pick-a-boon rooms, AFK farm expeditions, and keyed Trials and Rifts that guard the mythic gear sets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Chaptered story quests build from quiet preparation to the gate of the Demon God.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Slay the world boss <strong>Nethrax</strong> under hard rules — no potions, one life — to open the demon gate.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >An endless war</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The <strong>Demon God Invasion</strong>: infinite generated stages with bosses, generals, and milestone chests.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Every climb converts into permanent power — a never-resetting Dominion tree, awakened Mythics, and endgame set drops.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Face <strong>Vharzuul himself</strong> again and again: each fallen generation raises a stronger heir with a new demon type, so a different counter-champion carries each war.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4962700/extras/7ad9f537835e2683b1b654efbc25a106.avif?t=1785600214\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4962700/extras_big/7ad9f537835e2683b1b654efbc25a106.avif?t=1785600214 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every summon is earned in play. No microtransactions — just a broken world, a deep loop, and all the time it keeps working for you.</p>", "short_description": "Chronicles of Lumethis is a single-player idle RPG. Summon a roster of 70+ champions, forge shared gear, and push mines, dungeons, and rifts toward an endless war with the Demon God — progress that never resets, even while the game is closed.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4962700/9c0dc15614f4d920e05917434f18a9eb7bb71977/header.jpg?t=1785600214", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steams